(a) Identify the function as sine, cosine or tangent.
(b) State its period and maximum value.
(c) State its minimum value and where it occurs in $0^{\circ}\le\theta\le360^{\circ}$.
(d) State where the function is positive in $0^{\circ}<\theta<360^{\circ}$.
(e) Use the graph to decide whether its value at $50^{\circ}$ is greater than its value at $160^{\circ}$.
(f) State where the curve crosses the horizontal axis in $0^{\circ}\le\theta\le360^{\circ}$.

